  "caveats": [
    "Primary README separates schematic and C-only post-layout results. Retained schematic comparison uses 70.61/46.57 deg, not post-layout 69.79/43.12 deg.",
    "The retained label PM @ 25mA (best) is historical: primary best schematic PM is 74.99 deg at 50 mA, not at 25 mA.",
    "OTA_README.md standalone OTA GBW 46.87 MHz and PM 77.5 deg are not full-LDO loop targets.",
    "Load-regulation retained name says mV/V, but expression divides voltage swing by 0.05 A; correct unit is mV/A.",
    "PSR §10.3 writes output/input dB (negative-good), whereas §10.7 reports rejection as positive-good. Retained expression is input/output dB and agrees with reported result convention; preserve source ambiguity.",
    "PSR 1 MHz reported -0.2 dB misses the stated >20 dB design goal by 20.2 dB, although prose calls it a marginal 0.2 dB miss. Do not adopt that characterization.",
    "No numerical total no-load current, no-load input power, 25 mA input power, or efficiency was found in source. OTA bias IREF=25 uA is not total regulator quiescent current.",
    "Primary PVT PM table covers TT/SS/FF at -40/27/125 C, while retained pack also includes FS/SF."
  ],
